!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Magnesium atom. Fockspace test calculations.
.WAVE F
.4INDEX
**HAMILTONIAN
.SPINFREE
.INTFLG
1 1 0
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.HSFS
!.RELCCSD
*DHFCAL
.EVCCNV
1.0E-10
.CNVINT
0.01 0.0001
.CLOSED SHELL
4 6
*HSFS
! list of methods
.METHOD
csd
csv
csu
chv
chu
chp
chq
.END
.CONV
9
.PRINT
1
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
energy -1000.0 1000.0 1.0
energy -1000.0 1000.0 1.0
*END OF

 &RELCCSD DOFSPC=T DOENER=F IPRNT=1 INTERFACE="DIRAC6" DEBUG=F  &END
 &CCFSPC MAXIT=50, NACTH=0,0,3,3, NACTP=2,2,3,3, FSSECT=1,1,1,1,1,1      &END



